[signs]
5 10 Bluebrook lies east across the bridge. The road is the pale line through the grass; follow it and you cannot lose your way.
19 8 Bridge ahead. The river is deeper than it looks, so keep to the planks.
29 10 Bluebrook village: the apothecary's house and physic garden to the north, the woodcutter's cottage and vineyard to the south-east, the surveyor's office to the east. The road east leads on to the Yellow Brick Road.
34 15 The forest edge. Quiet folk and quieter creatures live here; walk gently.

